runar-sdk/src: the modules runar-sdk's contract.ts, state.ts and script-utils.ts import
(their import closure), copied unchanged except:
  - every `from 'runar-ir-schema'` reads `from '../../../../pool/runar-ir-schema.js'`
    (that package's barrel without its node-only Ajv validators);
  - anf-interpreter.ts takes ECDSA's `verify` from `@bsv/sdk`'s root export
    (`ECDSA.verify`) instead of the subpath `@bsv/sdk/primitives/ECDSA`, which
    @bsv/sdk 4's package exports do not name.
runar-ir-schema/src: the eight modules that barrel re-exports, copied unchanged.

Why vendored: runar-sdk 1.0.0-rc.1 is not published (npm has 0.4.6, on @bsv/sdk 2),
and its package.json names runar-ir-schema as pnpm `workspace:*`.
